<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-NEW ZEALAND BARBARIANS 86-0.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NEW ZEALAND BARBARIANS 86-0.</headline>
<dateline>HUDDERSFIELD, England 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Barbarians beat The North 86-0 (halftime 40-0) in a rugby union tour match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Andrew Blowers (3), Joeli Vidiri (3), Chris Cullen (2), Carlos Spencer (2), Ole Brown, Dylan Mika, Taine Randell, Mark Robinson. Conversions: Spencer (7), Mehrtens.</p>
</text>
